        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rituko ri’Omonene ngocha rire",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene bw’Emeganda nigo agoteeba iga: “Rora, rituko ngocha rire rigosamba buna omorero o riko. Erio abanto abaenenu bonsi, na abakori amabe bonsi, ’mbabe buna obonyansi obwomo, n’erituko erio rigocha nigo rirabasambe kegima, tirigotiga omori gose orosagia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase more inwe abamoirogete erieta riane, erioba ri’oboronge ’ndioroke rire nokogwenia inse ye chimbaaba chiaye. Inwe inamosoke mobe mogotiratiria buna chimori ekero chigosokigwa korwa ase obweri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko erio ’ndakore ring’ana erio, inwe imotiringe abakori amabe n’amagoro aino, na barabwo ’mbabe buna ribu.” Nabo Omonene bw’Emeganda agoteeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inwe inyora amachiiko a Musa, omosomba one, na emeroberio yonsi namochiigete agwo ase egetunwa kia Horebu, oborokererie Abaisraeli bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rora, nimbatomere Elija omobani atang’anere rituko riria rinene ri’Omonene ri’okoondokia ritaracha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nairanie chinkoro chi’abaise gochia ase abana babo, na echi’abana gochia ase abaise, erinde ekero ’ndache timbaisa goaka ense eye nokoragererigwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
